      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Armagh%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Armagh’s first school opened in 1799 in a log cabin, and the county’s first post office followed in 1805.",
